1. PWR_OFF 不再关闭 MCLK：板上 RESET(R52 NC) 悬空、PWDN 接地，
   停时钟后传感器无法复位，再次 PWR_ON 会读回 0x808
2. 保持 MCLK 常开后，连续多次打开 /dev/video0 均能正确识别

Change-Id: Ic4311b97b5fa8dd927f1774754a933889a11fd45
---
 drivers/media/platform/sunxi-vin/modules/sensor/ov5640.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/sunxi-vin/modules/sensor/ov5640.c b/drivers/media/platform/sunxi-vin/modules/sensor/ov5640.c
index 44832404b..754dfc766 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/sunxi-vin/modules/sensor/ov5640.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/sunxi-vin/modules/sensor/ov5640.c
@@ -3630,7 +3630,10 @@ static int sensor_power(struct v4l2_subdev *sd, int on)
 	case PWR_OFF:
 		sensor_print("PWR_OFF!\n");
 		cci_lock(sd);
-		vin_set_mclk(sd, OFF);
+		/* MangoPi Nezha-MQ: 板上 RESET(R52 NC)/PWDN(GND) 均不受控，
+		 * 停 MCLK 后传感器无法有效复位，再次 PWR_ON 时 SCCB 读到乱码。
+		 * 因此保持 MCLK 常开，采集之间不做无意义的掉电。 */
+		/* vin_set_mclk(sd, OFF); */
 		vin_gpio_write(sd, POWER_EN, CSI_GPIO_LOW);
 		vin_set_pmu_channel(sd, AFVDD, OFF);
 		vin_set_pmu_channel(sd, DVDD, OFF);
